{"3302230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Buried Whispers", "steam_appid": 3302230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4765900], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302230/extras/bd9350af52476528b5ba60e5979d7ec2.poster.avif?t=1780349328\" aria-label=\"Ritual progression\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302230/extras/bd9350af52476528b5ba60e5979d7ec2.webm?t=1780349328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302230/extras/bd9350af52476528b5ba60e5979d7ec2.mp4?t=1780349328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an innocent, find and capture crystals to complete a demonic ritual. But be careful. Secret moles are trying to stop you at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302230/extras/3fcca0560e37c78a515e8168de90ca81.poster.avif?t=1780349328\" aria-label=\"Explosion\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302230/extras/3fcca0560e37c78a515e8168de90ca81.webm?t=1780349328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302230/extras/3fcca0560e37c78a515e8168de90ca81.mp4?t=1780349328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a mole, secretly prevent the completion of the ritual by killing and sabotaging the innocents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302230/extras/641b39b2fe5f21b68c20d2ca0910b91e.poster.avif?t=1780349328\" aria-label=\"Proximity voice chat\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302230/extras/641b39b2fe5f21b68c20d2ca0910b91e.webm?t=1780349328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302230/extras/641b39b2fe5f21b68c20d2ca0910b91e.mp4?t=1780349328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to your friends using proximity voice chat. Enjoy hilarious voice effects, muffling, wobbling, and dynamic reverb that changes with room size. Optimized for maximum funniness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302230/extras/5fbb8c36d85056f913183401e0fa4166.poster.avif?t=1780349328\" aria-label=\"Cave destruction\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302230/extras/5fbb8c36d85056f913183401e0fa4166.webm?t=1780349328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302230/extras/5fbb8c36d85056f913183401e0fa4166.mp4?t=1780349328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and dig tunnels through an infinite number of fully destructible, randomly generated caves and never lose the sense of discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302230/extras/c6f93c91adfb8af2149caadd30e99365.poster.avif?t=1780349328\" aria-label=\"Vote menu\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302230/extras/c6f93c91adfb8af2149caadd30e99365.webm?t=1780349328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302230/extras/c6f93c91adfb8af2149caadd30e99365.mp4?t=1780349328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sacrifice your own health to cast as many votes as you want. Bluff about your votes and catch the others off-guard. How much risk are you willing to take?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302230/extras/2a26ce67e264314ab6c70b3dbea72c2d.poster.avif?t=1780349328\" aria-label=\"Use of multiple items including rocket launcher\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302230/extras/2a26ce67e264314ab6c70b3dbea72c2d.webm?t=1780349328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302230/extras/2a26ce67e264314ab6c70b3dbea72c2d.mp4?t=1780349328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone can kill anyone. Think you know who the mole is? Do the dirty work yourself.  Explode them, stab them, and even... drug them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302230/extras/7cee6d07dc8133932de843001635192b.poster.avif?t=1780349328\" aria-label=\"Player avoiding a meeting by wearing a gasmask\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302230/extras/7cee6d07dc8133932de843001635192b.webm?t=1780349328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302230/extras/7cee6d07dc8133932de843001635192b.mp4?t=1780349328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show up to meetings naturally, instead of being teleported intrusively. But don't be late. Sluggishness is a death sentence. Skip meetings entirely and fake your death by using a gasmask and throw off the group.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feature:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity chat with hilarious voice effects and advanced audio processing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic cinema betrayals and social deduction gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully destructible, procedurally generated caves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone can kill anyone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An array of funny items and weapons to use</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A number of biomes with their own environmental hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your health is a limited resource you can use to vote multiple times in one meeting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organic meetings where everyone is forced back to the ritual naturally, instead of being teleported. This leaves the opportunity to skip meetings entirely using a gasmask</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"ht