ity voice chat\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302230/extras/641b39b2fe5f21b68c20d2ca0910b91e.webm?t=1780349328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302230/extras/641b39b2fe5f21b68c20d2ca0910b91e.mp4?t=1780349328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to your friends using proximity voice chat. Enjoy hilarious voice effects, muffling, wobbling, and dynamic reverb that changes with room size. Optimized for maximum funniness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302230/extras/5fbb8c36d85056f913183401e0fa4166.poster.avif?t=1780349328\" aria-label=\"Cave destruction\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302230/extras/5fbb8c36d85056f913183401e0fa4166.webm?t=1780349328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302230/extras/5fbb8c36d85056f913183401e0fa4166.mp4?t=1780349328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and dig tunnels through an infinite number of fully destructible, randomly generated caves and never lose the sense of discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302230/extras/c6f93c91adfb8af2149caadd30e99365.poster.avif?t=1780349328\" aria-label=\"Vote menu\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.ste